{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54520","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云起处（京本作「气至」），形色（辛本、川本作「行色」）重而乌。\n暗伏贼兵（京本作「师」）军不见，露其形体（京本作「体象」）在高隅，一半是番胡。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}